Package: vijMulti
Type: Package
Title: vijMulti: Multivariate Data Analyses
Version: 0.0.1
Author: Vincent Jalby
Maintainer: Vincent Jalby <vincent.jalby@unilim.fr>
Description: Main classic multivariate data analyses (Principal Component
    Analysis, Correspondence Analysis and Multiple Correspondence Analysis),
    built with ggplot2 and offering extensive customization options.
    The module is available in the <strong>Multivariate</strong> tab.
    Project source (and changelog) is available at
    <a href="https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti" target="_blank">Github</a>.
License: GPL (>=3)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, utils, stats, grDevices, psych, rlang,
         ggplot2, scales, ggpp, ggrepel, ggforce, GPArotation, FactoMineR,
         grid
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    vdiffr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti
BugReports: https://github.com/vjalby/vijMulti/issues
